\n    [#AF87FF]gate_lookup[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate_lookup: add one scan-once resolver for pending task_triage and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bead_snooze bundles that reports each gate's kind, request id, project, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bead id, and producing chop, and move the existing per-bead triage scan [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]onto it.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make the reconciler converge on gates it no longer tracks[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]chop_sweep[dim] · [dim][/dim]after gate_lookup[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chop_sweep: cancel pending gates stranded by a project that left the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]enabled inventory and by a lost or corrupt state file, without [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cancelling gates for a project that is merely unreadable this pass.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Settle bead gates from sase bead close[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]close_settle[dim] · [dim][/dim]after gate_lookup[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]close_settle: have the close command cancel each closed task bead's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pending gate right after the store mutation commits, so the existing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]notifications inotify watch refreshes ACE at once, and keep the added [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cost off closes that cannot have gates.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-k0","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-k0.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-cfa718588630eaeebf6be5030ce9e6e0","started_at":"2026-08-12T15:00:23.803227+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"6ad66